        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: St. Anthony Messenger, Revolver\n- Organizations: Franciscan Friars (O.F.M.) of St. John the Baptist Province, NewBay Media, Franciscan Media, Archbishop of Cincinnati\n- Places: Cincinnati, Ohio, United States\n- Concepts: Roman Catholic family magazine, rock and heavy metal magazine, multimedia company\n\nFacts:\n- St. Anthony Messenger is a national Roman Catholic family magazine published in Cincinnati, Ohio, in the United States by the Franciscan Friars (O.F.M.) of St. John the Baptist Province.\n- St. Anthony Messenger has the explicit ecclesiastical approval of the Archbishop of Cincinnati.\n- Revolver is a bi-monthly rock and heavy metal magazine published by NewBay Media.\n- Franciscan Media was formerly named St. Anthony Messenger Press.\n- Franciscan Media is a multimedia company that includes St. Anthony Messenger magazine, Franciscan Media and Servant books, Catholic Greetings, Saint of the Day, Minute Meditations, and AmericanCatholic.org.\n- Franciscan Media's products are used by millions of people primarily in the United States and also worldwide.",
